  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      {{ site.title }} is a reading companion for board game rules. Each game has
      a set of authored pages — a rulebook, a summary, a glossary and a book
      index — cross-linked to each other and searchable within that game.
    </p>

    {#
      The feature section. Every card demonstrates itself rather than
      describing itself: the search box searches, the type controls change the
      type on this page, the copy-link copies. A list of claims about a reading
      tool is the one thing a reading tool should not need.
    #}
    <h2 id="cool">What we think is cool about {{ site.title }}</h2>
  </div>

