    <li class="brag">
      <h3 class="brag__title">One box, one rulebook, five people</h3>
      <p class="brag__body">
        The oldest problem at a table: the rules are a physical object and only
        one person can hold them. Here everybody has the whole book, at once,
        and nobody has to ask for it back.
      </p>
      <p class="brag__demo brag__demo--quiet">
        It prints, too — so the person who prefers paper can still have paper.
      </p>
    </li>

