  <div class="prose">
    <h2 id="how-it-works">How it works</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Every section has a permanent anchor, so a link you save keeps working.</li>
      <li>Search on a game’s page only ever returns results from that game.</li>
      <li>
        Bookmarks, favorites and reading settings live in your browser. No
        account, no server, nothing uploaded, no tracking.
      </li>
      <li>
        Which also means they stay on one device, go when you clear your
        browsing data, and are deleted by Safari after about a week without a
        visit. Reading preferences will download a copy of everything, and read
        one back.
      </li>
      <li>Every page is laid out for print as carefully as it is for screen.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="content">Content</h2>
    <p>
      Rules text belongs to its publishers and designers and is reproduced here
      as a reading aid. Corrections are welcome via
